    <p class="content-note">eSIM Card's short-validity tiers make its smallest plan look cheaper, but it's also a shorter window of days than UPeSIM's 7-day minimum. UPeSIM doesn't sell an unlimited tier at all, unlike eSIM Card's two.</p>
  </div>

